00:10:42,733 --> 00:10:45,700
老妈你能不能真实一点
Lǎo mā nǐ néng bùnéng zhēnshí yìdiǎn
Mom, can you be a little more realistic?

283
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:48,266
你明明觉得自己是女强人
Nǐ míngmíng juédé zìjǐ shì nǚqiángrén
You clearly consider yourself a strong woman.

284
00:10:49,266 --> 00:10:50,600
不敢说女强人
Bù gǎn shuō nǚqiángrén
I dare not say she is a strong woman

285
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:53,100
最起码比较自立吧
Zuìqīmǎ bǐjiào zìlì ba
At least they are relatively independent.

286
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:55,066
好谢谢老妈
Hǎo xièxiè lǎo mā
Okay, thank you, Mom.

287
00:10:55,266 --> 00:10:57,300
好的那今天呢
Hǎo de nà jīntiān ne
Okay, so what about today?

288
00:10:57,300 --> 00:11:01,033
我让世界上最会省钱的两个人
Wǒ ràng shìjiè shàng zuì huì shěng qián de liǎng gè rén
I let the two most frugal people in the world...

289
00:11:01,133 --> 00:11:03,400
教你们怎么省钱
Jiāo nǐmen zěnme shěng qián
I'll teach you how to save money

290
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,933
然后你们就会有更多钱
Ránhòu nǐmen jiù huì yǒu gèng duō qián
Then you'll have more money.

291
00:11:06,066 --> 00:11:07,633
学会了吗
Xué huìle ma
Have you learned it?

292
00:11:07,733 --> 00:11:09,833
那今天的作业就是
Nà jīntiān de zuòyè jiùshì
So today's homework is...

293
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:14,233
你要花两块九买40双袜子
Nǐ yào huā liǎng kuài jiǔ mǎi 40 shuāng wàzi
You need to spend 2.9 yuan to buy 40 pairs of socks

294
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:17,733
然后呢你要走路一个小时
Ránhòu ne nǐ yào zǒulù yígè xiǎoshí
Then you have to walk for an hour.

295
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:21,600
去最便宜的菜市场买菜
Qù zuì piányí de càishìchǎng mǎi cài
Go to the cheapest farmers market to buy vegetables.

296
00:11:21,933 --> 00:11:23,733
OK去做作业吧
OK qù zuò zuòyè ba
OK, go do your homework.

297
00:11:23,733 --> 00:11:24,266
下课
Xiàkè
get out of class ended

